<h1>Hello World! - Plenty\Carbon Test</h1>

<h2>diffInSeconds (absolute = true, default)</h2>
<ul>
    <li>past→future: <strong>{{ pastToFuture }}</strong> (should be positive)</li>
    <li>future→past: <strong>{{ futureToPast }}</strong> (should ALSO be positive)</li>
</ul>

<h2>diffInMinutes (absolute = true, default)</h2>
<ul>
    <li>past→future: <strong>{{ pastToFutureMinutes }}</strong> (should be positive)</li>
    <li>future→past: <strong>{{ futureToPastMinutes }}</strong> (should ALSO be positive)</li>
</ul>

<h2>diffInSeconds (absolute = false)</h2>
<ul>
    <li>future→past: <strong>{{ signed }}</strong> (should be NEGATIVE)</li>
</ul>

<h3>✅ If both absolute values are positive and signed is negative, Plenty\Carbon works correctly!</h3>
